      <slug></slug>
      <title>The free software desktop’s graphics driver stack</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>X.org</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;4 years after the modular X tree was released, we can clearly see that we did not fully satisfy all expectations and that we are really holding the free software desktop back.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In this talk, the current situation gets analysed, and the next step, providing more integrated graphics driver stacks, a change that will make life easier for all involved, is introduced and demonstrated.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="3101">Luc Verhaegen</person>
      </persons>
      <links></links>
      <video></video>
      <end></end>
  </event>